reviewer_concerns.value:
Main concerns from reviewers include:

1. Comparisons omit recent SOTA inference-time debiasing;

2. “Lightweight” claim lacks parameter/latency numbers;

3. Multi-attribute motivation not matched by intersectional evaluation;

4. Limited variance/significance analysis;

5. Unclear lexicon supervision and how quantization changes attention;

6. Generalization beyond English/aligned models and reproducibility (missing code) questioned.
